From: Amphion Runtime <runtime@amphion.local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(speaker): materialize global feature mean

Avoid evaluating the column mean through the same Eigen map while its rows are
being overwritten. Community-1 requires every feature frame to be centered by
one fixed whole-window mean.
---
 .../csrc/speaker-embedding-extractor-general-impl.h       | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sherpa-onnx/csrc/speaker-embedding-extractor-general-impl.h b/sherpa-onnx/csrc/speaker-embedding-extractor-general-impl.h
index 5b10da2..882857b 100644
--- a/sherpa-onnx/csrc/speaker-embedding-extractor-general-impl.h
+++ b/sherpa-onnx/csrc/speaker-embedding-extractor-general-impl.h
@@ -139,7 +139,8 @@ class SpeakerEmbeddingExtractorGeneralImpl
         Eigen::Matrix<float, Eigen::Dynamic, Eigen::Dynamic, Eigen::RowMajor>>(
         p, num_frames, feat_dim);
 
-    m = m.rowwise() - m.colwise().mean();
+    const Eigen::RowVectorXf mean = m.colwise().mean();
+    m.rowwise() -= mean;
   }
 
  private:
-- 
2.51.0.windows.1
